{"4220590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DJ till Dawn", "steam_appid": 4220590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You wake up with <strong>DJnesia</strong>.</i><br><i>Your skills? Gone.</i><br><i>Your memory? Hazy.</i><br><i>A mysterious girl is telling you it’s time to get on stage.</i><br><i>There’s only one way to figure out what’s going on...<strong> START PLAYING!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DJ till Dawn</strong> is a rhythm roguelite where you battle the crowd one track at a time, turning perfect timing, cool DJ finger guns and powerful gear into a build capable of surviving the night. Hit the beat. Attack the crowd. <strong>Stay alive till 6AM! </strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HIT BEATS. FIRE FINGER GUNS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hit <strong>finger gun beats</strong> to damage the crowd. The higher your combo, the stronger your moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220590/extras/59dbada68932479f0a7edc331391dbd3.poster.avif?t=1788344755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220590/extras/59dbada68932479f0a7edc331391dbd3.webm?t=1788344755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220590/extras/59dbada68932479f0a7edc331391dbd3.mp4?t=1788344755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BUILD YOUR SET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every track grants <strong>new finger guns or stat increases</strong> for the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220590/extras/a9572b5ea604aedfeb8eace76a35bb1a.poster.avif?t=1788344755\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220590/extras/a9572b5ea604aedfeb8eace76a35bb1a.webm?t=1788344755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220590/extras/a9572b5ea604aedfeb8eace76a35bb1a.mp4?t=1788344755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GET STRONGER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Buy and unlock <strong>permanent upgrades</strong> and gear between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220590/extras/b4fd95ed93acb80033a1d5c49fc1183d.poster.avif?t=1788344755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220590/extras/b4fd95ed93acb80033a1d5c49fc1183d.webm?t=1788344755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220590/extras/b4fd95ed93acb80033a1d5c49fc1183d.mp4?t=1788344755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>IMPRESS THE CROWD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take on their <strong>challenges</strong> and unlock special prizes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_